role	path	name	purpose	accepts	destinations	questions
subject-kind	subject-kinds/package	Package	A NuGet package version: its metadata, dependencies, target frameworks, files, libraries, and audit and vulnerability facts.		package	What does this package depend on, per target framework? Does this package version have known vulnerabilities? Which files and libraries does this package ship?
subject-kind	subject-kinds/library	Library	A .NET library image: its references, metadata, dependency structure, IL-derived analyses, and the types it declares.		library, type	Which assemblies does this library reference? Does this library have namespace dependency cycles? Where does this library allocate, box, or use unsafe code? Which types does this library declare?
subject-kind	subject-kinds/type	Type	One type in a library: its members, base class, interfaces, derived types, and source.		member	What members does this type declare? What does this type derive from, and what derives from it? Where is this type's source?
subject-kind	subject-kinds/member	Member	One member of a type, or one overload of it: its signature, body, calls and callers, costs, and source.		member-overload, member-detail	What does this method call, and what calls it? Where is this member's source? What does this method allocate?
operation	operations/package-query	Package Query	Finds the packages in a source that match facet terms such as prefix, license, dependencies, or a string literal in their libraries.	package	package-query	Which packages depend on a given package? Which packages ship a library containing a given string? Which packages with a given prefix use a given license?
operation	operations/package-files	Package Files	Lists every file in one acquired package version, in a stable order.	package	package-files	Which files does this package ship? Where in this package is a given file?
operation	operations/diff-analysis	Diff analyses	Compares two versions of a library, type, or member through one registered analysis, such as API, allocation, IL, or string literals.	library, type, member	analyses	What changed in this library's public API between two versions? Did this method's allocations or IL change between versions? Which string literals did this library add or remove?
reference	references/vocabularies	Value vocabularies	The stable values that product queries accept, such as API accessibility, C# style choices, and C# body kinds, with the inputs that accept each one.		vocabularies	Which values may I pass to this option? Which C# body kinds can I search for? What does this value mean, and which inputs accept it?
reference	references/component-contracts	Component contracts	Owner-issued contracts for explaining extracted declarations without realizing their content.		component-contracts	Which declaration kinds can be explained, and what do their fields mean?
